## Main Deliverables

- `final_report/`  
  Contains the final written report. This is the main paper for the project. It describes the research question, data sources, optimization framework, equity results, prediction-market extension, limitations, and conclusions.

- `implementation_code/`  
  Contains the notebooks used to implement and reproduce the main experiments. These include the monthly equity optimizer, daily equity extension, standalone equity and Polymarket demo, and prediction-market panel experiments.

- `llm_exploration/`  
  Contains the LLM exploration log. This document explains how LLMs were used throughout the project for ideation, code scaffolding, debugging, data inspection, writing, and presentation preparation, while distinguishing LLM assistance from our own modeling and research decisions.

- `self_critiques/`  
  Contains the final self-critique. This document reflects on project scope, validation choices, limitations, LLM use, and future research directions.

- `readme/`  
  Contains this reproducibility guide.

